.png", "id": "601163856129974", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392003_601163859463307_2912029382375061944_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DlvZRgH--hYQ7kNvwG0j8lF&_nc_oc=AdpzgcQ2xHWy--Kvlvotm4A0KWqLBbIO_-FlsMoUngYO9MR0MhR9rRMcsFDPkwOY-rA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9bLPwoebWk3dmlhTdx9aOBagkswQpqnQyoXuHYf5yt5g&oe=6A4275F8"}, {"file_name": "Beauty salon Landscape.png", "id": "598807939682111", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392010_598807943015444_6165353311321110163_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZI2LdWhq4MwQ7kNvwE2RNiR&_nc_oc=AdpmL7VefzxrmbkWyz7Sd-PBbw4j9cMy109PGb4R35G0lYuFmezyq4yAsHeMd7GiS6Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9HUWmG1Iy5rq5U0yKu4vcKLu64QCURbRCz9Ldqvk4Bww&oe=6A429068"}]}, "id": "4148856942068344", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "Untitled design - 2025-01-27T010738.614.png", "id": "631361879341242", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394043_631361882674575_5739349984879630095_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=k636QXObNTIQ7kNvwGX37AM&_nc_oc=Adpyiv9anzc1JMN4PxeJvDUSfZL1e84GZ9zJIvXTZOyi1sXgIoOl6Yr6wyHasnej8Tw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-0ZJJmWn0afdf7Y_xTKh7DLu6w7II1VXsh3WjFPb9BoA&oe=6A427901"}, {"file_name": "Untitled design - 2025-01-27T011753.784.png", "id": "487288381069581", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_487288384402914_1503056743130149930_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zrn99qULHEwQ7kNvwEDK1Pj&_nc_oc=AdprSyi07031ZVgDJuV2iFO_TH82z-boBM0qukmGPDzI_wvgWXx_EUKvrNn6S-teLwc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-QoKcIm1_jVwVt7d4B3DbmP-lcySciBQLeCIoa0x5i4Q&oe=6A426EE6"}, {"file_name": "12.png", "id": "1738699837061898", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391969_1738699840395231_7219042639569130772_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GLlBgLdZNpMQ7kNvwGifFjv&_nc_oc=Adqrf_mnJLGg_hEfAdKr1i72tSJTvvLLnopXUztq973RUw5Sfh_ti6ufxc8qZ66w5xs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-AEh7RdSHCyfURRLy_APVxwa7T11ed2Atsvr2QOG4QOA&oe=6A4267A8"}, {"file_name": "Untitled design - 2025-01-31T231303.164.png", "id": "943494907976974", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393328_943494914643640_3531812979695030460_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MOJOulXu1wYQ7kNvwHUmNL2&_nc_oc=Adr8EjI9zIVjdyk4D3yBo5OYQqFfzHFXHw__MbDFiQ3S1vjtSdVUMm9CAbgxmC2N2Ks&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8TzR1eRRzUHfUBlf6v_1tH-q_cgWOclpogYPHwNXDPcQ&oe=6A4270DF"}, {"file_name": "com.keycapgames.beautysalon-20250126-131127.png", "id": "640972868599630", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391902_640972871932963_5436091301397640580_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y7T7H64UnrAQ7kNvwHsbiPx&_nc_oc=AdpxV_VBAwwUfBgJuC1BQBicjf7aK0G1k4QwjIN_Qc1IpZh4KYAQslOlNPSFbFxAlog&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-9XF6VpVVqQdudqVeJJyYie5asNbXlfTJasURqsFtG4g&oe=6A4291F0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Beauty salon Landscape.png", "id": "1315695026239959", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392298_1315695029573292_8593302982734425761_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5oiQJvGll-MQ7kNvwEIWiAK&_nc_oc=Adobyg670KN7dETtpGEfoNN28N7LqoDHtu4dU1c6n_ocPjpfCoYeQKiYr5GFYxW4l2E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8jiWbeiZQxChiUDQ7rgLi5blRS6fTEQMAVeO7vnkrz9Q&oe=6A4278B7"}, "display_name": "Beauty Salon Simulator VR", "keywords": ["Beauty", "Salon", "Makeup", "Fashion", "Shave"], "long_description": "# \u2728Features **Three** Main Sections\n\n# \ud83d\udc84Makeup Section\ud83d\udd8c\ufe0f\nStep into the role of a **makeup artist**, offering a wide range of **cosmetic services**. From applying **blush, eyeshadow, mascara, glitter and liner** to switching up **hair styles, brows, lashes and eye lenses**\n{9684685488230550}\n\n**coloring** hair lashes and brow, each look is yours to create. Enhance skin with a **scrub and steam** routine, experiment with **artistic markers**. Top it off with **lipstick** classic, glossy, or glitter finishes, and personalize it further with **accessories** like **glasses, lenses, or nose piercings**. Every brushstroke offers a chance to **explore your creativity**.\n\n# \ud83d\udc85 Nails & Pedicure Section \ud83d\udc63\nOffer clients a relaxing **manicure** and **pedicure** service by **filing** and **polishing fingernails** and **toenails**, refreshing their feet with a **scrub brush**. Take it a step further by attaching **stylish nail extensions**, giving each client a personalized look that truly stands out.\n{631906926192569}\n\n\n# \ud83d\udcf8 Photography Section \ud83d\udc57\ncapture your clients' final look by letting them take **stunning photos** with a **virtual camera**, change their outfit for a unique style, and use a **green screen to switch backgrounds**. Adjust **poses and facial expressions** for the perfect shot, then **pin and store** your favorite styles on your wall of fame to celebrate your best creations.\n{552888147793719}\n\n# Early Access\nWe\u2019re planning to continuously enhancing the experience by adding more **customization options**, new **styling tools**, and a wider range of **makeup extensions**. Can't wait to hear your feedback!", "short_description": "Step into the ultimate virtual beauty salon experience! Transform your clients with a variety of makeup, pedicure tools, extensions, accessories and outfits in this creative and relaxing simulation sandbox. Customize every detail of their look, snap stunning photos, and let your imagination shine!"}]}, "develop